<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68978" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῠδ-άω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύδος</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be
				damp, dripping</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόνου μυδώσας σταγόνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					1278
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυδῶσα κηκίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1008
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόνῳ μυδόωντες</span>
				(v.l. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όεντες</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ὀδόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					308
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύροις μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.198
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Hedyl.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυδόωσα ἀπὸ χροὸς ἔρρεε λάχνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1531
				</span></i>
			; of ulcers, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ulc.</u>
				10
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυρεοὶ] ὑπὸ τῶν ὄμβρων . . μυδῶντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.25.7
				</span></i>
			; of the eyelids (v. sq.), <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.71
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				72
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be damp, clammy</i> from decay, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὰρξ μυδῶσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VC</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			; of a corpse, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				410
			</span></i>.</div>
